name: Incantation — number generator
author: corpus
description: >-
  Incantation destroys 1 random card, then adds 4 random Enhanced numbered cards to the
  deck. First-shop spectral number engine: pair with Even Steven, Fibonacci, Hack.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - spectralCard: Incantation
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: EvenSteven
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Fibonacci
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Hack
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
